Name: ONNX Runtime
Short Name: onnxruntime
URL: https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime
Version: 1.31.0
Revision: 402979ac1bef89dcd55add41eaa7277c407599eb
License: MIT
License File: LICENSE
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Description:
Microsoft's ONNX Runtime runs Tark's live caption models (D4) on the device.
Tark uses the official macOS arm64 release,
onnxruntime-osx-arm64-1.31.0.tgz, sha256
1031b36dd3bdaa8d976a6130d9cf2a05e9be320b93ae804f8427b91dc3432afc
(downloads-onnxruntime.ini). The speech helper process loads
libonnxruntime.1.31.0.dylib at run time; LICENSE and ThirdPartyNotices.txt
are the release's own.

Local Modifications:
None. Tark sets ORT_DISABLE_TELEMETRY=1 before loading the library and calls
DisableTelemetryEvents, so the release's telemetry stays off.
